# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The store Worker's asset server reads these rules too (Workers static assets), so only add a rule the Worker already
# answers itself, before its assets (commerce/worker/redirects.js; a test checks this). Anything else would apply on
# the Worker as well: an /admin rule, for one, sent the back office round in circles there.
#
# Exact /us (and trailing slash) → domain root. Do NOT splat /us/* —
# /us/guides and /us/assets must keep serving at their current paths.
/us https://www.shopapgo.com/ 301
/us/ https://www.shopapgo.com/ 301

# /go/* package-insert QR short links (docs/marketing/go-links.md). The store Worker answers these first
# (commerce/worker/redirects.js); listed here for Cloudflare Pages too. 302 so targets can change without reprinting.
/go/apply /us/guides/how-to-apply-glaze-coating?utm_source=amazon_insert&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=guides 302
/go/wet-or-dry /us/guides/wet-or-dry-application?utm_source=amazon_insert&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=guides 302
/go/streaks /us/guides/ceramic-spray-streaks-high-spots?utm_source=amazon_insert&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=guides 302
/go/wash-wait /us/guides/how-long-to-wait-to-wash-after-ceramic-spray?utm_source=amazon_insert&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=guides 302
/go/colored /us/guides/how-to-apply-colored-glaze?utm_source=amazon_insert&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=guides 302
/go/guides /us/guides?utm_source=amazon_insert&utm_medium=qr&utm_campaign=guides 302
